# Dream: SELECT held on the Setup page. Off in every recipe. Up from Off, Wild deals a dream; up from Wild, the knob
# keeps it; on, the next number. Range 0 leaves the sound; 100 moves it, and a part the recipe has off stays off
# (Last Light: no bass, no pulse). With the piece; gone with the recipe. A project from the dealers' build (format 13)
# keeps its settings, Dream Off.
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 100
expect view 7
expect par67 0
press SEL
wait 100
shot off.png
spin K2 -30
wait 100
expect par68 0
spin K1 1
wait 100
expect par67 1
expect dreamdealt 1
expect par0 60
expect par18 72
expect par22 0
expect par53 0
expect par39 4
shot wild.png
spin K1 1
wait 100
expect dreamkept 1
spin K1 1
wait 100
expect dreamkept 1
spin K2 100
wait 100
expect par68 100
expect dreamkept 1
expect dreamdealt 1
shot range.png
release SEL
wait 100
expect view 7
# a hand on the instruments: the Pad's Colour to Noir, kept until the next turn of Dream
tap ENV
wait 100
spin K4 -5
spin K4 3
wait 100
expect par22 3
tap GLO
wait 100
press SEL
wait 100
spin K3 0
wait 100
expect par22 3
release SEL
wait 100
tap SAVE
wait 200
reboot
wait 300
expect dreamkept 1
turn PRESET 1
wait 300
expect piece 1
expect par2 0
expect par3 0
tap GLO
wait 100
expect view 7
press SEL
wait 100
spin K2 100
spin K1 1
wait 100
expect par67 1
expect dreamdealt 1
expect par2 0
expect par3 0
release SEL
wait 100
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
wait 100
expect par67 0
expect par68 30
storev13 13
reboot
